# Top-level navigation order for mkdocs-awesome-pages.
#
# Without this file the nav is ASCII filename order, which sorts CLAUDE.md and
# DIRECTION_TYPES ahead of "About" for no reason a reader can see.
#
# The trailing "..." is load-bearing: it catches every page not named here, so a
# new doc always appears in the nav even if nobody updates this file.
nav:
  - README.md
  - configuration
  - guides
  - internals
  - xil-pipeline
  - samples
  - about.md
  - ...
